WEBVTT

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.513
expansion and peak.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:35.117
This is his first time
speaking publicly about WeWork.

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:41.810
DF: I think we tried
to do a lot as a company.

00:04:41.834 --> 00:04:44.840
you know, what's the saying,
start-ups don't die of starvation,

00:04:44.864 --> 00:04:46.021
they die of indigestion.

00:04:47.181 --> 00:04:48.570
I think we did a lot,

00:04:48.594 --> 00:04:51.651
I think we tried to do a lot of things,

00:04:51.675 --> 00:04:54.333
which probably led to over-committing

00:04:54.357 --> 00:04:58.076
and not following through
with things at times.

00:04:58.527 --> 00:05:01.500
But I don't think
that there was ill intent.